	//oc:doc "The bound task's ``type_key`` — the panel row's second line (外包沒有角色名, the task type IS its role line). \"\" = 自由代辦 / unresolvable task. Previously a client-side join against ``GET /api/tasks`` (T-a3e4). additive-optional."
	//oc:field default=""
