	//oc:doc "Indices into ``options`` of every option that was circled; ``null`` when the card was answered with free text / attachments only, or is not answered yet. The server stores it DEDUPED and ASCENDING, so ``[2,0]`` and ``[0,2]`` are indistinguishable once stored. A ``single`` card accepts at most one index (two is a 400)."
	//oc:field null req
