//oc:route GET /api/task-manuals/{type_key}
//oc:id handle_get_task_manual_api_task_manuals__type_key__get
//oc:summary "Read one task manual (purpose/fields/SOP/learnings/assignee). The SOP and the learnings are judged by two SEPARATE caps: read sop_md_cap_chars and learnings_cap_chars. The older cap_chars is DEPRECATED — it carries the LEARNINGS cap only and says nothing about sop_md, so read sop_md_cap_chars for the SOP."
